    // can't trust the combo's shown value as the "good" one. Instead:
    //   - committedIndex() returns the true committed item from the model (never
    //     polluted by a native cycle), and we always restore to that;
    //   - the accept-vs-reject decision is DEFERRED ~50 ms, so both onItemSelected
    //     and onMouseWheel have fired by the time we decide. A change is committed
